    {"id": "continue-zh-06", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "我再补充一点，客户希望周五之前交付。", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-zh-07", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "说到这里，我想起了去年的那次事故。", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-01", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "So then yesterday I went to the store and prices were way up.", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-02", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "The second point is that the budget stays under a hundred thousand.", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-03", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "Anyway, that's exactly what he told me back then.", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-04", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "Next I'm going to cover last month's sales numbers.", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-05", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "So I think the problem is somewhere in the supply chain.", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-06", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "One more thing, the client wants delivery before Friday.", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "continue-en-07", "language": "en", "group": "stay_continue", "sentence": "Which reminds me of that accident last year.", "expected": "stay"},

