    {"id": "other-zh-02", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_other_person", "sentence": "宝贝，该吃饭了，先把手洗干净。", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "other-zh-03", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_other_person", "sentence": "妈，我晚上不回去吃了。", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "other-zh-04", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_other_person", "sentence": "小李，会议室订好了吗？", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "other-zh-05", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_other_person", "sentence": "你们几个先坐下，马上开始。", "expected": "stay"},
    {"id": "other-zh-06", "language": "zh-Hans", "group": "stay_other_person", "sentence": "师傅，麻烦前面路口停一下。", "expected": "stay"},
